       "            criterion: {&quot;gini&quot;, &quot;entropy&quot;, &quot;log_loss&quot;}, default=&quot;gini&quot;<br><br>The function to measure the quality of a split. Supported criteria are<br>&quot;gini&quot; for the Gini impurity and &quot;log_loss&quot; and &quot;entropy&quot; both for the<br>Shannon information gain, see :ref:`tree_mathematical_formulation`.</span>\n",
